{"seq":2,"slug":"rrf-fusion","title":"RRF 倒数秩融合与权重","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/elasticsearch-vector-hybrid-search/hybrid-fusion/rrf-fusion","wordCount":2671,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"rrf-倒数秩融合与权重\">RRF 倒数秩融合与权重</h1><p>两路召回结果拿到手后，最省心的融合方式不是想办法把分数对齐，而是干脆不用分数。倒数秩融合（Reciprocal Rank Fusion，RRF）只看一条文档在每个列表里排第几，把&quot;位置&quot;这个天然可比的量当作唯一输入。这个决定看起来像是在丢弃信息，实际上它丢弃的恰恰是两条栈里最不可比的那部分——BM25 的绝对分值与向量相似度的绝对分值是两种不同量纲的产物，而&quot;第 1 名&quot;在两边含义完全一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>倒数秩融合是一种 rank-based（基于名次）的融合方法：它把每一路召回的结果只看作一个有序列表，用 &quot;<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>常数</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>名次</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/(\\text{常数} + \\text{名次})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">常数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">名次</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>&quot; 把名次换算成分数，再把同一条文档在多个列表里的换算分相加。与它相对的是 score-based（基于分数）的融合，后者要先让两路分数可比再相加。</p>\n<p>之所以要有 rank-based 这条路，是因为&quot;让两路分数可比&quot;在实践中比想象中贵：它要求你监控两路分数的分布、选择归一化方式、调权重，并且在语料或模型变化后重新校准。rank-based 用丢弃分数幅值换来&quot;零校准&quot;，代价是丢失了分数间隔信息。</p>\n<p>两种方法的适用条件可以对照：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>倾向 rank-based（RRF）</th>\n<th>倾向 score-based（线性加权）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>两路分数尺度是否可比</td>\n<td>不可比（典型：BM25 与余弦）</td>\n<td>可比或已归一化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否有标注数据支撑权重</td>\n<td>没有</td>\n<td>有判断列表与离线指标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分数分布是否稳定</td>\n<td>不稳定或常漂移</td>\n<td>稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据是否含极端值/长尾</td>\n<td>是（科学语料、日志）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>相关性信号是否稀疏</td>\n<td>是（点击、购买）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;第一名遥遥领先&quot;是否需要保留</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  A[&quot;BM25 top-N 列表&quot;] --&gt; C[&quot;名次换算&quot;]&#10;  B[&quot;向量 top-N 列表&quot;] --&gt; C&#10;  C --&gt; D[&quot;同名次累加&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; E[&quot;融合分数排序&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F[&quot;截断到 size&quot;]\">graph LR\n  A[\"BM25 top-N 列表\"] --&gt; C[\"名次换算\"]\n  B[\"向量 top-N 列表\"] --&gt; C\n  C --&gt; D[\"同名次累加\"]\n  D --&gt; E[\"融合分数排序\"]\n  E --&gt; F[\"截断到 size\"]</pre><p>图中没有任何一步需要两路的绝对分数，这是 RRF 对分数分布漂移免疫的原因，也是它相对线性融合在运维上更省心的全部来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"融合公式与它的三个性质\">融合公式与它的三个性质</h2><p>RRF 对文档 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 的分数定义是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>RRF</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>result</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></munder><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>rank</mtext><mi>q</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RRF}(d) = \\sum_{q:\\, d \\in \\text{result}(q)} \\frac{1}{k + \\text{rank}_q(d)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RRF</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.8374em;vertical-align:-1.516em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">:</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">result</span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rank</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 遍历每一次召回（每个子 retriever 或子查询），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>rank</mtext><mi>q</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{rank}_q(d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rank</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 在第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 个结果列表里的名次（从 1 开始），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 是秩常数（API 里叫 <code>rank_constant</code>）。公式里有三个性质值得逐个看清楚。</p>\n<p>第一，名次是唯一输入，分数幅值完全不参与。这意味着一条文档如果在一路里排第 1、在另一路里排第 100，它的贡献是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{k+1} + \\frac{1}{k+100}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2484em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2484em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">100</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，与它在两路里的绝对分差无关。这消掉了归一化的全部麻烦：你不需要知道 BM25 的分数分布，也不需要监控向量相似度的直方图。</p>\n<p>第二，多个列表的贡献相加，因此&quot;在多个列表里都排得靠前&quot;的文档会获得累加收益。这是 RRF 相对单路检索的核心增益来源——它天然奖励被两个独立信号同时认可的文档。</p>\n<p>第三，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 控制低名次的衰减速度。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 越大，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mtext>rank</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{k + \\text{rank}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2484em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rank</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 随名次下降得越慢，低名次文档的影响力越强；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 越小，头部名次越被放大。ES 文档给出的默认 <code>rank_constant</code> 是 60，OpenSearch 的 <code>score-ranker-processor</code> 默认同样是 60（来源：Elasticsearch RRF retriever 参考, <a href=\"https://www.elastic.co/docs/reference/elasticsearch/rest-apis/retrievers/rrf-retriever\">https://www.elastic.co/docs/reference/elasticsearch/rest-apis/retrievers/rrf-retriever</a> 与 OpenSearch score-ranker processor, <a href=\"https://docs.opensearch.org/latest/search-plugins/search-pipelines/score-ranker-processor/）。\">https://docs.opensearch.org/latest/search-plugins/search-pipelines/score-ranker-processor/）。</a></p>\n<p>用一组具体数字看这个衰减：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k = 60</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span></span></span></span></span> 时，第 1 名的贡献是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>61</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.0164</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/61 \\approx 0.0164</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/61</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.0164</span></span></span></span></span>，第 10 名是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>70</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.0143</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/70 \\approx 0.0143</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/70</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.0143</span></span></span></span></span>，第 50 名是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>110</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.0091</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/110 \\approx 0.0091</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/110</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.0091</span></span></span></span></span>。从第 1 名到第 50 名，贡献只降到约 55%——这正是 RRF &quot;温和&quot;的原因，它不会因为某条文档在一路里排得靠后就几乎判死。</p>\n<h2 id=\"rank_window_size-与两个窗口\">rank_window_size 与两个窗口</h2><p>融合时有一个容易忽略的问题：每个子召回返回多少条参与融合？ES 用 <code>rank_window_size</code> 控制这件事。对 RRF retriever，<code>rank_window_size</code> 定义&quot;每个子结果集在融合前取前多少条&quot;，最终融合结果再截断到请求的 <code>size</code>。它的约束是必须不小于 <code>size</code> 且不小于 1（来源：Elasticsearch RRF retriever 参考, <a href=\"https://www.elastic.co/docs/reference/elasticsearch/rest-apis/retrievers/rrf-retriever）。\">https://www.elastic.co/docs/reference/elasticsearch/rest-apis/retrievers/rrf-retriever）。</a></p>\n<p>对纯 kNN 子召回，两者还有一个约定的交互：如果 kNN 的 <code>k</code> 大于 <code>rank_window_size</code>，结果会被截断到窗口大小；如果 <code>k</code> 更小，结果集保持 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 条大小。因此只调 <code>k</code> 而不调 <code>rank_window_size</code> 时，可能有一部分召回结果根本没进入融合。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"POST /documents/_search&#10;{&#10;  &quot;retriever&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;rrf&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;retrievers&quot;: [&#10;        {&#10;          &quot;retriever&quot;: {&#10;            &quot;standard&quot;: {&#10;              &quot;query&quot;: { &quot;multi_match&quot;: { &quot;query&quot;: &quot;vector search latency&quot;, &quot;fields&quot;: [&quot;title^2&quot;, &quot;body&quot;] } }&#10;            }&#10;          }&#10;        },&#10;        {&#10;          &quot;retriever&quot;: {&#10;            &quot;knn&quot;: {&#10;              &quot;field&quot;: &quot;body_vector&quot;,&#10;              &quot;query_vector_builder&quot;: {&#10;                &quot;text_embedding&quot;: {&#10;                  &quot;model_id&quot;: &quot;.multilingual-e5-small_linux-x86_64&quot;,&#10;                  &quot;model_text&quot;: &quot;vector search latency&quot;&#10;                }&#10;              }&#10;            }&#10;          }&#10;        }&#10;      ],&#10;      &quot;rank_window_size&quot;: 100,&#10;      &quot;rank_constant&quot;: 60&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;size&quot;: 10&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">POST /documents/_search</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"retriever\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"rrf\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"retrievers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"retriever\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            \"standard\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">              \"query\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"multi_match\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"query\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"vector search latency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"fields\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"title^2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"body\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] } }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"retriever\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            \"knn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">              \"field\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"body_vector\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">              \"query_vector_builder\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">                \"text_embedding\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">                  \"model_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\".multilingual-e5-small_linux-x86_64\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">                  \"model_text\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"vector search latency\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"rank_window_size\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"rank_constant\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"size\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这里 <code>rank_window_size</code> 设为 100、<code>size</code> 设为 10 的组合是有意为之：窗口开大是为了让&quot;在某一路排 30-100 名但在另一路排前 5&quot;的文档有机会进入融合，而最终只返回 10 条。窗口开大的代价是每路要多返回与多保存结果，延迟随窗口上升。</p>\n<h2 id=\"rrf-与-opensearch-的-score-ranker-processor\">RRF 与 OpenSearch 的 score-ranker-processor</h2><p>OpenSearch 用 search pipeline 里的 <code>score-ranker-processor</code> 实现同一套公式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"PUT /_search/pipeline/rrf-pipeline&#10;{&#10;  &quot;description&quot;: &quot;Post processor for hybrid RRF search&quot;,&#10;  &quot;phase_results_processors&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;score-ranker-processor&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;combination&quot;: {&#10;          &quot;technique&quot;: &quot;rrf&quot;,&#10;          &quot;rank_constant&quot;: 1&#10;        }&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PUT /_search/pipeline/rrf-pipeline</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Post processor for hybrid RRF search\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"phase_results_processors\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"score-ranker-processor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"combination\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"technique\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rrf\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"rank_constant\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>配置项与 ES 基本对应，但有两点不同。第一，OpenSearch 允许在 <code>combination</code> 上直接指定 <code>rank_constant</code>（上例设为 1 只是为了数值好读，生产默认是 60；<code>rank_constant</code> 合法范围为 [1, 10000]）。第二，OpenSearch 文档明确给出了可用 <code>weights</code> 的可选参数——RRF 在 OpenSearch 里可以给不同子查询加权，而 ES 的 RRF retriever 文档明确写明&quot;每个子 retriever 在 RRF 公式中权重相等&quot;。如果业务上确实需要&quot;向量侧占 70%&quot;，在 ES 里需要改用 <code>linear</code> retriever，而在 OpenSearch 里 RRF 本身就能承载权重。（来源：OpenSearch score-ranker processor, <a href=\"https://docs.opensearch.org/latest/search-plugins/search-pipelines/score-ranker-processor/\">https://docs.opensearch.org/latest/search-plugins/search-pipelines/score-ranker-processor/</a> 与 Elasticsearch RRF retriever 参考, <a href=\"https://www.elastic.co/docs/reference/elasticsearch/rest-apis/retrievers/rrf-retriever）\">https://www.elastic.co/docs/reference/elasticsearch/rest-apis/retrievers/rrf-retriever）</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"rrf-与线性融合的工程量差异\">RRF 与线性融合的工程量差异</h2><p>两种融合方式的选择不应只看相关性指标，还要看运维成本。把差异整理成表：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>RRF（秩融合）</th>\n<th>线性加权（分数融合）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>输入</td>\n<td>名次</td>\n<td>分数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否需要归一化</td>\n<td>不需要</td>\n<td>必须（min-max / L2 / z-score）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分数间隔信息</td>\n<td>丢弃（第 1 名领先第 2 名多少无关）</td>\n<td>保留</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调参面</td>\n<td><code>rank_constant</code>、<code>rank_window_size</code></td>\n<td>归一化方式、组合方式、权重、分数上下界</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据分布漂移的影响</td>\n<td>无（只依赖相对顺序）</td>\n<td>有（归一化统计量随结果集变化）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对稀疏信号的表现</td>\n<td>好（点击/购买这类信号只提供名次）</td>\n<td>差（稀疏信号没有稳定的分数分布）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对异常值的鲁棒性</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>差（min-max 与 L2 都对极值敏感）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分片数变化的影响</td>\n<td>有（名次由分片归并决定）</td>\n<td>有（分数分布随参与分片变化）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OpenSearch 里的额外能力</td>\n<td>可加权</td>\n<td>可设分数上下界</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后两行是实打实的坑。RRF 依赖全局名次，而全局名次来自协调节点对分片本地结果的归并，因此分片数变化会改变名次、进而改变融合排序——这使得&quot;索引分片数&quot;成为一个影响相关性的参数（这也意味着扩容分片时要重跑评估，不能假设相关性不变）。线性融合则在前一份文档里面对归一化统计量随结果集变化的问题。</p>\n<p>OpenSearch 文档给出一组可供参考的量化结论：在六个 BEIR 数据集上的 NDCG@10 基准中，RRF 的平均分数比基于分数的融合管线低 3.86%，而搜索延迟与协调节点 CPU 利用率相当（延迟上 RRF 略优：p50 改善 1.62%、p90 改善 1.42%、p99 改善 0.78%）。这个数字的用法不是&quot;RRF 更差所以别用&quot;，而是&quot;RRF 用一个可测量的相关性代价换掉了整个归一化调参面&quot;。对于刚开始做混合检索、还没有标注数据来支撑权重选择的团队，这个交换通常是划算的。（来源：OpenSearch 官方博客「Introducing reciprocal rank fusion for hybrid search」, <a href=\"https://opensearch.org/blog/introducing-reciprocal-rank-fusion-hybrid-search/）\">https://opensearch.org/blog/introducing-reciprocal-rank-fusion-hybrid-search/）</a></p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  Q[查询] --&gt; A[BM25 召回 top-N]&#10;  Q --&gt; B[向量召回 top-N]&#10;  A --&gt; C[得到名次列表 1]&#10;  B --&gt; D[得到名次列表 2]&#10;  C --&gt; E[&quot;RRF: sum 1/(rank_constant + rank)&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[全局融合排名]&#10;  F --&gt; G[截断到 size]&#10;  G --&gt; H{相关性达标?}&#10;  H --&gt;|否, 且能静态判定某侧权重| I[迁移到 linear/归一化路线]&#10;  H --&gt;|否, 但分数分布不稳定| J[调大 rank_constant 或窗口]&#10;  H --&gt;|是| K[上线并持续监控]\">graph TD\n  Q[查询] --&gt; A[BM25 召回 top-N]\n  Q --&gt; B[向量召回 top-N]\n  A --&gt; C[得到名次列表 1]\n  B --&gt; D[得到名次列表 2]\n  C --&gt; E[\"RRF: sum 1/(rank_constant + rank)\"]\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[全局融合排名]\n  F --&gt; G[截断到 size]\n  G --&gt; H{相关性达标?}\n  H --&gt;|否, 且能静态判定某侧权重| I[迁移到 linear/归一化路线]\n  H --&gt;|否, 但分数分布不稳定| J[调大 rank_constant 或窗口]\n  H --&gt;|是| K[上线并持续监控]</pre><p>图中第一个否分支指向线性融合，第二个否分支留在 RRF 内部——这个分流依据是&quot;你能否为权重选择给出稳定依据&quot;，而不是&quot;哪个分数更高&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"何时该离开-rrf\">何时该离开 RRF</h2><p>RRF 的盲区有一个清晰的特征：<strong>当分数间隔本身携带业务信息时</strong>。典型场景是&quot;一个精确匹配的文档应当压倒其余所有结果&quot;——用户输入产品型号 <code>SC-4820-BK</code>，唯一精确命中的文档在 BM25 里分数遥遥领先，RRF 却只把它当作&quot;第 1 名&quot;，与第二名之间的巨大分差被抹平，于是在向量路里排第 2 的语义相近文档可能反超。这类查询在电商与工单检索里占比不低，识别方法是抽样看头部查询的分数分布：如果相当一部分查询的第一名分数是第二名的数倍，RRF 就在这些查询上系统性变差。</p>\n<p>反向的盲区是两路名单几乎不重叠时 RRF 的收益趋近于零：一条文档只在一路里出现时，它的 RRF 分数只有一个加项，与单路检索无异。此时 RRF 的价值只剩&quot;两个列表的并集被统一排序&quot;，而如果你更需要的是&quot;两路各自贡献一半席位&quot;，线性加权更直接。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>RRF 只用名次，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>RRF</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>∑</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>rank</mtext><mi>q</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RRF}(d) = \\sum \\frac{1}{k + \\text{rank}_q(d)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RRF</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3874em;vertical-align:-0.5423em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rank</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5423em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，因此完全绕开分数归一化问题。</li>\n<li><code>rank_constant</code> 默认 60（两个栈一致），加大它会让低名次文档更有影响力；<code>rank_window_size</code> 决定每个子结果集参与融合的条数，必须不小于 <code>size</code>。</li>\n<li>ES 的 RRF retriever 各子召回等权；需要给某一路加权时用 <code>linear</code> retriever，或在 OpenSearch 里给 <code>score-ranker-processor</code> 配 <code>weights</code>。</li>\n<li>RRF 用可测量的相关性代价（官方基准中六个 BEIR 数据集平均 NDCG@10 低 3.86%）换掉了归一化与权重调参面，对没有标注数据的团队是合理起点。</li>\n<li>分片数变化会改变全局名次从而改变 RRF 排序，扩容分片后必须重跑评估。</li>\n<li>当&quot;第一名遥遥领先&quot;这类查询占比高时，RRF 会抹平关键的分差，应迁移到分数融合路线。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>如果你已经确认需要保留分数间隔，下一步是选归一化方式并解决权重调参，见 <a href=\"linear-weighted\">线性加权归一化与调参</a>；如果融合后的结果仍然有&quot;排得不对&quot;的头部问题，那是重排要解决的事，见 <a href=\"../rerank-filter/cross-encoder-rerank\">交叉编码器重排与延迟预算</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"RRF 倒数秩融合与权重","id":"rrf-倒数秩融合与权重"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"融合公式与它的三个性质","id":"融合公式与它的三个性质"},{"level":2,"text":"rank_window_size 与两个窗口","id":"rank_window_size-与两个窗口"},{"level":2,"text":"RRF 与 OpenSearch 的 score-ranker-processor","id":"rrf-与-opensearch-的-score-ranker-processor"},{"level":2,"text":"RRF 与线性融合的工程量差异","id":"rrf-与线性融合的工程量差异"},{"level":2,"text":"何时该离开 RRF","id":"何时该离开-rrf"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"KNN 与 BM25 并行召回","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/elasticsearch-vector-hybrid-search/hybrid-fusion/knn-bm25-combine"},"next":{"title":"线性加权归一化与调参","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/elasticsearch-vector-hybrid-search/hybrid-fusion/linear-weighted"}}